ed-wudi-sons","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p001","quote":"武帝二十六男：楊元后生毗陵悼王軌、惠帝、秦獻王柬。審美人生城陽懷王景、楚隱王瑋、長沙厲王乂。徐才人生城陽殤王憲。匱才人生東海沖王祗。趙才人生始平哀王裕。趙美人生代哀王演。李夫人生淮南忠壯王允、吳孝王晏。嚴保林生新都懷王該。陳美人生清河康王遐。諸姬生汝陰哀王謨。程才人生成都王穎。王才人生孝懷帝。楊悼后生渤海殤王恢。餘八子不顯母氏，並早夭，又無封國及追諡，今並略之。其瑋、乂、穎自有傳。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p001:m0089","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p001:m0000"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-jin064-yun-father-wu","interpretation_note":"依本源明示生父接既有司馬鈞家族；ID字母只為唯一子支位置，不代表出生排行。收繼與母系另存，不改生父。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIA"}},{"id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIADB","label":"迪","status":"provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"迪","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008:m0034"]},{"surface":"漢王","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008:m0045"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008","mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008:m0034","quote":"迪"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008","mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008:m0045","quote":"漢王"}],"identity_note":"本來源角色及具名/個別稱謂明確，跨篇是否另有同人可另存候選，不由slot字母證獨特歷史身份。","source_identity_bindings":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons","source_role":"di","proper_mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008:m0034","c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p008:m0045"],"status":"source_local_reading","historical_distinctness_not_proven":true,"human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"本來源角色及具名/個別稱謂明確，跨篇是否另有同人可另存候選，不由slot字母證獨特歷史身份。"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,